------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ABOUT THIS REPOSITORY
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository contains the text of the Amtgard Rules of Play (Version 8,
V8.7 "Soupy", dated 2025-07-26) restructured into Markdown, together with
derived reference materials (indexes, verification tooling, and printable
Level 1 class cards).

The underlying rules text and all associated trademarks are the property of
Amtgard International. This repository was prepared by Avery W. Krouse acting
as an Amtgard International volunteer under a Copyright Work for Hire and
Transfer Agreement (effective 2026-02-07). Under that agreement the work is a
"work made for hire," and all rights, title, and interest in the work product
created here belong exclusively to Amtgard International from the moment of
creation.

