International, for distribution to its members, at a cost no greater than 10%
above the price for the reproduction of this material (rounded up to the next
dollar).

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AUTHORITATIVE SOURCE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is a reformatted edition provided for reference and tooling. In any
conflict between this repository and the official rulebook published at
https://www.amtgard.com, the official rulebook is authoritative.
